---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../components/ui/Section.astro';
import Prose from '../components/ui/Prose.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Hina Shahrukh & Co. handles personal data from visitors to this website.">
  <Section width="narrow" space="lg">
    <Prose variant="legal">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated June 2026. This policy covers visitors to this website. The privacy and confidentiality of client engagements is governed by separate engagement letters and, where applicable, non-disclosure agreements.</p>
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>Hina Shahrukh &amp; Co. is a Chartered Accountancy firm registered in 2015 under the Institute of Chartered Accountants of Pakistan (ICAP). Website: <a href="https://hsco.pk">https://hsco.pk</a>. Contact: <a href="mailto:mail@hsco.pk">mail@hsco.pk</a>.</p>
      <h2>What data we collect and why</h2>
      <p>We collect limited personal data from visitors, such as names, email addresses and IP addresses, to respond to enquiries and keep the site secure. This may be collected through forms, cookies and plugins.</p>
      <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact forms:</strong> if you submit a form, we retain your details to respond. We do not use form submissions for marketing.</li>
      <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> we use cookies to improve your experience, such as remembering preferences. Cookies expire after varying periods depending on their purpose.</li>
      <li><strong>Media:</strong> if you upload images to the site, avoid including embedded location data, which others could extract.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site so we can improve it. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google’s Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>
      <h2>Who we share your data with</h2>
      <p>We do not sell your data. We share it only where needed to run the site (for example, hosting or technical support), and we expect those providers to handle it responsibly.</p>
      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>We keep personal data only as long as needed for the purpose it was collected, or as required by law. Enquiry correspondence is retained for our records and then deleted.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You may ask us for a copy of the personal data we hold about you, or ask us to correct or erase it. This does not extend to data we are required to keep for legal, administrative or security reasons. To make a request, email <a href="mailto:mail@hsco.pk">mail@hsco.pk</a>.</p>
      <h2>How we protect your data</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect personal data, including access controls and secure hosting. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, but we work to safeguard the information we hold.</p>
      <h2>Where your data is sent</h2>
      <p>Visitor submissions may be checked by an automated spam-detection service to maintain the quality and safety of interactions on the site.</p>
      <h2>Caching</h2>
      <p>This site uses LiteSpeed caching to improve response times. Cached files are temporary and may be cleared at any time. See the <a href="https://quic.cloud/privacy-policy/">LiteSpeed privacy policy</a> for details.</p>
      <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time; the version on this page is the current one. Questions about your privacy: <a href="mailto:mail@hsco.pk">mail@hsco.pk</a>.</p>
    </Prose>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
